activate_project: Activate a workspace for a repository path
analyze_blast_radius: Analyze the impact of changing a symbol
create_file: Write content to a file, creating it if needed
delete_memory: Delete a memory file by name
echo: Echo arguments back as-is for debugging
edit_memory: Edit a memory using search and replace
explain_cluster: Cluster member detail
explain_symbol_deep: Deep symbol explanation
find_files: Search for files by name pattern
find_implementations: Find all implementations of an interface or abstract method
find_references: Find all references to a symbol
find_related_symbols: Related symbols around a seed
format_code: Format a file using the language server formatter
fuzzy_edit: Apply a fuzzy text edit using search/replace with context matching
get_call_hierarchy: Find all callers or callees of a function or method
get_change_impact_graph: Change impact subgraph
get_cluster_map: Workspace cluster overview
get_code_actions: Get available code actions (quick fixes) for a location
get_context: Get relevant code context for a set of files
get_diagnostics: Get compiler errors and warnings for a file
get_health: Check workspace health and language server status
get_hover_info: Get type information and documentation for a symbol
get_repo_map: Get a ranked overview of repository structure and key files
get_semantic_context: Semantic context retrieval
get_semantic_graph_status: Semantic index status
get_symbol_overview: List all symbols defined in a file with their types
get_token_budget: Get token budget for current profile and mode
get_tool_help: Get detailed usage documentation for an MCP tool
get_type_hierarchy: Get the type hierarchy (supertypes and subtypes)
go_to_definition: Jump to where a symbol is defined
index_semantic_graph: Index the semantic graph
insert_after_symbol: Insert code after a symbol definition
insert_before_symbol: Insert code before a symbol definition
list_directory: List files and directories in a path
list_memories: List all available memory files
onboard_project: Get an orientation guide for the current project
ping: Echo a message back for connectivity testing
prepare_for_new_conversation: Prepare a summary for handing off to the next session
read_file: Read the contents of a file
read_memory: Read a specific memory file by name
refresh_semantic_graph: Refresh live overlay
rename_memory: Rename or move a memory file
rename_symbol: Rename a symbol across the entire workspace
replace_in_file: Replace text in a file using exact string matching
replace_symbol_body: Replace the entire body of a function, method, or class
safe_delete_symbol: Remove a symbol definition from a file
search_in_files: Search file contents using regex patterns
search_memories: Full-text search across all memory files
search_symbols: Search for symbols by name across the workspace
switch_mode: Switch operational mode (read/edit/review/admin)
validate_graph_edge: Validate a graph edge claim
verify_edit: Check for compilation errors after an edit
write_memory: Save project knowledge to a named memory file
